        "id": 1014252
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-10T06:56:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see the usecase for tagging with the git describe content as name. Which commit do you tag?",
      "parentUuid": "12785a4b_3403590f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "30169a96b1ea1e474adf4bb0664b7cde64ba1413",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
