      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T09:48:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We also `release` our internal Gerrit version with the output of `git describe` as \"release version\" without creating that tag. The creation of the tag is an unnecessary step as the output of `git describe` is as unambiguous as a tag.\nWhat do you feel is the added value of creating a tag?",
      "parentUuid": "c65e05ce_a7268e1a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "30169a96b1ea1e474adf4bb0664b7cde64ba1413",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
